5" owner_email="ahassani@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="10" project="aosp/platform/system/update_engine" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/aosp/platform/system/update_engine" ref="refs/changes/65/674165/10" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Id8b0f2bb462b4e6a8cb93fa69d171066be7e6860" commit="386b9951d02e26bddff0f2b0a3994a0e3b24d67a" commit_message="fastboot: Reuse the Galaxy Nexus phone's VID/PID by default  Reuse the VID/PID of the Galaxy Nexus phone for boards that don't have an official one.  Also correct smaug's PID.  BUG=b:63407238 TEST=build and boot  Change-Id: Id8b0f2bb462b4e6a8cb93fa69d171066be7e6860 Signed-off-by: Jeffy Chen &lt;jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/706751 Reviewed-by: Julius Werner &lt;jwerner@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="706751" owner_email="jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/depthcharge" ref="refs/changes/51/706751/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ibeff06ca0effcd27024a9a4f1828f2aad88cdef7" commit="41964b12278e40d5868a26f0f1d2397e7a91fc71" commit_message="autotest: Add 4K 30fps vp8 video to video_PlaybackPerf  BUG=chromium:770607 TEST=video_PlaybackPerf on peach_pit  Change-Id: Ibeff06ca0effcd27024a9a4f1828f2aad88cdef7 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/694402 Commit-Ready: Hirokazu Honda &lt;hiroh@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Hirokazu Honda &lt;hiroh@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Pawel Osciak &lt;posciak@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="694402" owner_email="hiroh@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/02/694402/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Id0ef3ecc0b3e611b4cb24210ab4bfe82543a2ecd" commit="7c63134310941806193c6b681d3739f977bd12b5" commit_message="[autotest] Create containers on separate threads.  Places the creation of each individual LXC container on its own thread in the Pool.  This has two benefits: - Parallelism. - Robustness.  Failures or hanging of one container creation thread will not   block the operation of the rest of the Pool.  Other notes:  - A timeout of 10 minutes is placed on container creation.  If a container takes   more than 10 minutes to create, that operation is cancelled.  The timeout is   adjustable. - Container creation is throttled.  No more than 5 concurrent creations can take   place at once.  The throttle is adjustable.  BUG=chromium:720219 TEST=pool_unittest.py  Change-Id: Id0ef3ecc0b3e611b4cb24210ab4bfe82543a2ecd Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/671479 Commit-Ready: Ben Kwa &lt;kenobi@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Ben Kwa &lt;kenobi@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Ilja H. Friedel &lt;ihf@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Dan Shi &lt;dshi@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="671479" owner_email="kenobi@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="12" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/79/671479/12" remote="cros" total_fail_count="4"/><pending_commit branch="chromeos-4.4" change_id="Idd1f76728c2d033ef509c5c72d05cd0077126a35" commit="f771f10d3a70ed6ea478fefad92db113ef8a09e7" commit_message="CHROMIUM: container config: enable OVERLAY_FS and FS_DAX  We want DAX enabled for crosvm, and OVERLAY_FS for certain container platforms.  BUG=none TEST=kernel compiles  Change-Id: Idd1f76728c2d033ef509c5c72d05cd0077126a35 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/707340 Commit-Ready: Stephen Barber &lt;smbarber@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Stephen Barber &lt;smbarber@chromium.org&